#X text 744 500 IMPORTANT NOTES:;
#X text 767 520 - torch.rfft~/torch.irfft~ are designed to be used in subpatches with [block <winsize> <overlap>];
#X text 765 553 - torch.rfft~ handles windowing and overall normalization \, but the final overlap-related normalization is better handled by torch.irfft~;
#X text 746 602 so:;
#X text 770 620 - torch.rfft~ must have -window AND -norm to have windowing and window-based normalization;
#X text 770 650 - torch.irfft~ usually will have -overlap_factor or -of followed by the number of overlaps (4 in this example);
